{
    "title": "ToonMe photo cartoon maker",
    "description": "<p>Do you feel like creating a <strong>cartoon me</strong> photo art of your selfie? Are you looking for a fresh new avatar for your Instagram profile? Look no more! With <strong>ToonMe</strong>, a cartoon creator and selfie editor with loads of face filters, you can turn your selfie into astonishing art that makes you stand out!</p>\r\n<p>You can <strong>cartoon yourself</strong> in any way you want, and the outcome is only one tap away. Our <strong>cartoon creator</strong> features an enormous library of <strong>photo filters</strong>, everything from simple designs to popular TV shows can be found in this truly amazing <strong>avatar creator</strong>. Wanna look like Arya from House Stark of Winterfell? No problem! Just click on the preset, add your own photo and there you go - you have a fearsome direwolf right beneath your beautiful face! Whether it is a 3D cartoon face or a full-body photo art, AI powered <strong>ToonMe</strong> delivers outstanding results within just seconds.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Wonderful Profile Picture Maker</strong>\r\n<p>ToonMe is the coolest app to create and edit pictures for your social networks. Making an awesome <strong>profile pic</strong> has never been any easier - all you have to do is just take a photo, choose from hundreds of art filters, and let the <strong>portrait AI</strong> do all the work for you! And if that\u2019s not enough, you can always<strong> toon up</strong> your already breathtaking pic with awesome tools like adding animation, custom texts and mind-blowing <strong>filters for pictures</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Stunning Backgrounds & Photo Effects</strong>\r\n<p>Have you ever dreamed of having your own portrait painted by a professional artist? With this app you can have your own photo art customized with all sorts of <strong>photo editor effects</strong>. Say you have a nice photo, but you don\u2019t like the <strong>background</strong>? ToonMe got you covered! This astonishing picture editor can change the background of your photos while keeping the high quality on top of adding some more filters for pictures and <strong>lens effects</strong> to make your pictures look like real <strong>photo art</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Cartoon Photo Editor to Unleash Your Imagination</strong>\r\n<p>Along with many other things, ToonMe is a <strong>picture editor</strong> with a lot of awesome visual effects and tools to edit and<strong> toon</strong> your photos. While using numerous styles and beauty filters, you get to decide which parts of your photos will be affected by the <strong>filters</strong> you chose, which makes this picture editor extremely customizable. This easy-to-use avatar maker will make you feel like a true artist - you can do anything with your photos, from removing a background to adding one of your own to make a beautiful and <strong>original photo</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Choose and Go</strong>\r\n<p>Keep all the things you need at your fingertips - you have instant access to all the latest trends, best oil painting filters, the coolest styles and <strong>lens effects</strong>. All you gotta do is just select, apply and if you want to, share your <strong>cartoon photo</strong> of your friends with just one tap on your screen!</p>\r\n<p>Think of it as your personal digital artist and <strong>cartoon creator</strong> ready to make your toon dream come true, from simple ready-to-use art filters to amazing animated pictures. Everything is delivered in high quality as if it was created in a professional <strong>photo editor</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>What happens to your <strong>cartoon picture</strong> next is totally up to you - who are we to limit you, right? Surprise your friends by sharing the result on your favorite social networks like Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, you name it. Or let <strong>ToonMe</strong> be your <strong>profile picture maker</strong> and update your user pic as often as you want. Feel like keeping it private and only sending it via messenger? Whatever makes you happy!</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>Do you feel like creating a <strong>cartoon me</strong> photo art of your selfie? Are you looking for a fresh new avatar for your Instagram profile? Look no more! With <strong>ToonMe</strong>, a cartoon creator and selfie editor with loads of face filters, you can turn your selfie into astonishing art that makes you stand out!</p><br><p>You can <strong>cartoon yourself</strong> in any way you want, and the outcome is only one tap away. Our <strong>cartoon creator</strong> features an enormous library of <strong>photo filters</strong>, everything from simple designs to popular TV shows can be found in this truly amazing <strong>avatar creator</strong>. Wanna look like Arya from House Stark of Winterfell? No problem! Just click on the preset, add your own photo and there you go - you have a fearsome direwolf right beneath your beautiful face! Whether it is a 3D cartoon face or a full-body photo art, AI powered <strong>ToonMe</strong> delivers outstanding results within just seconds.</p><br><br><strong>Wonderful Profile Picture Maker</strong><br><p>ToonMe is the coolest app to create and edit pictures for your social networks. Making an awesome <strong>profile pic</strong> has never been any easier - all you have to do is just take a photo, choose from hundreds of art filters, and let the <strong>portrait AI</strong> do all the work for you! And if that\u2019s not enough, you can always<strong> toon up</strong> your already breathtaking pic with awesome tools like adding animation, custom texts and mind-blowing <strong>filters for pictures</strong>.</p><br><br><strong>Stunning Backgrounds &amp; Photo Effects</strong><br><p>Have you ever dreamed of having your own portrait painted by a professional artist? With this app you can have your own photo art customized with all sorts of <strong>photo editor effects</strong>. Say you have a nice photo, but you don\u2019t like the <strong>background</strong>? ToonMe got you covered! This astonishing picture editor can change the background of your photos while keeping the high quality on top of adding some more filters for pictures and <strong>lens effects</strong> to make your pictures look like real <strong>photo art</strong>.</p><br><br><strong>Cartoon Photo Editor to Unleash Your Imagination</strong><br><p>Along with many other things, ToonMe is a <strong>picture editor</strong> with a lot of awesome visual effects and tools to edit and<strong> toon</strong> your photos. While using numerous styles and beauty filters, you get to decide which parts of your photos will be affected by the <strong>filters</strong> you chose, which makes this picture editor extremely customizable. This easy-to-use avatar maker will make you feel like a true artist - you can do anything with your photos, from removing a background to adding one of your own to make a beautiful and <strong>original photo</strong>.</p><br><br><strong>Choose and Go</strong><br><p>Keep all the things you need at your fingertips - you have instant access to all the latest trends, best oil painting filters, the coolest styles and <strong>lens effects</strong>. All you gotta do is just select, apply and if you want to, share your <strong>cartoon photo</strong> of your friends with just one tap on your screen!</p><br><p>Think of it as your personal digital artist and <strong>cartoon creator</strong> ready to make your toon dream come true, from simple ready-to-use art filters to amazing animated pictures. Everything is delivered in high quality as if it was created in a professional <strong>photo editor</strong>.</p><br><p>What happens to your <strong>cartoon picture</strong> next is totally up to you - who are we to limit you, right? Surprise your friends by sharing the result on your favorite social networks like Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, you name it. Or let <strong>ToonMe</strong> be your <strong>profile picture maker</strong> and update your user pic as often as you want. Feel like keeping it private and only sending it via messenger? Whatever makes you happy!</p>",
